---
title: Translate a selection from the Chrome extension (context menu → side panel → REST → LLM)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant P as Web page
    participant BG as Extension service worker<br/>(background.js)
    participant SP as Side panel<br/>(sidepanel.js)
    participant C as Open Liberty<br/>(Jakarta Security)
    participant R as TranslatorResource
    participant S as TranslationService
    participant L as LlmClient<br/>(Gemini / Ollama)

    U->>P: select text, right-click
    U->>BG: "Translate "%s" to Darija"
    BG->>SP: chrome.sidePanel.open(windowId)
    BG->>P: scripting.executeScript(getSelection)
    P-->>BG: selected text
    BG->>SP: storage.session.set(pendingSelection)
    SP->>SP: paste text into the input (auto-translate)
    SP->>C: POST /translator/api/translate<br/>Authorization: Basic base64(user:pass)<br/>{"text": "...", "script": "arabic"}
    C->>C: BasicAuthenticationMechanism.validateRequest()
    C->>C: InMemoryIdentityStore.validate(credential)
    alt invalid or missing credentials
        C-->>SP: 401 Unauthorized + WWW-Authenticate: Basic
        SP-->>U: "Wrong username or password" (opens Settings)
    else valid caller (role "translator")
        C->>R: translate(TranslationRequest)
        R->>S: translate(text, sourceLang, script)
        alt cache hit
            S-->>R: TranslationResult (cached = true)
        else cache miss
            S->>S: PromptBuilder.systemPrompt() / userMessage()
            S->>L: complete(systemPrompt, userMessage)
            L->>L: HTTPS POST models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent
            L-->>S: raw model text
            S->>S: cleanOutput() + cache.put()
            S-->>R: TranslationResult
        end
        R-->>SP: 200 OK TranslationResponse (JSON)
        SP-->>U: Darija shown, copied to clipboard, read aloud (optional)
    end
